1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_epoch_bug_subjectparam.sas - Bug regression: SUBJECT= not used in SQL
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_epoch
5           * Expected         : SUBJECT= selects the subject key used everywhere; with
6           *                    SUBJECT=SUBJID the mapping must work and USUBJID is not needed
7           * Status           : OPEN
8           * Original defect  : the array-sizing query hard-codes "group by usubjid", so a
9           *                    SE= without USUBJID raises "column usubjid not found" and the
10          *                    output dataset is left with 0 observations
11          * Test passes when the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED)
12          *============================================================================*/
